  "details": "Several users on social media report a \"mobile app\" version (I don't know if it's Android or iOS) displaying the incorrect trust rank text. A \"Known User\" trust rank reportedly displays an orange shield icon correctly, but the text says \"Trusted User\".\n\nNo steps to repro because I don't have a device to test with, might want to look around at known user profiles in the Android/iOS companion app and on devices with ≥ 6 GB RAM on the standalone in-client behavior.\n\nExternal report (OP and 2 comments claiming the issue, 36 upvotes): https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/1wwsi46/anyone_notice_that_the_ranks_are_wrong_in_the/",
